{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cnab-parser-collection",
    "name": "CNAB Parser",
    "description": "## CNAB Parser\n\nAPI collection for the CNAB Parser system.\n\n### Services\n- **User Service** (port 7001): Authentication and user management\n- **Upload Service** (port 7003): CNAB file upload and processing\n- **CNAB Service** (port 7002): Transaction storage and queries\n\n### Authentication\n- **JWT**: User endpoints require Bearer token. Use **Login** first to auto-set the token.\n- **Fernet**: Upload-service to cnab-service communication (internal).\n\n### Environment Variables\n- `user_service_url`: http://localhost:7001\n- `upload_service_url`: http://localhost:7003\n- `cnab_service_url`: http://localhost:7002\n- `encoded_token`: JWT token (auto-set by Login)\n- `upload_id`: Last upload ID (auto-set by Upload CNAB)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "cnab-parser"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "User Service",
      "description": "Authentication and user management endpoints (port 7001).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "GET Health Check",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/health",
                  "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"],
                  "path": ["health"]
                },
                "description": "## Health Check\n\nReturns service name, version and current timestamp.\nNo authentication required."
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "Success (200)",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "url": { "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/health", "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"], "path": ["health"] }
                  },
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "body": "{\n  \"service\": \"user-service\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"dt\": \"2026-04-01T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n}"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Authentication",
          "description": "JWT authentication endpoints.\n\nThe **Login** request automatically sets the `encoded_token` environment variable for use in all subsequent requests.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "POST Login",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                      "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                      "    pm.environment.set('encoded_token', jsonData.encoded_token);",
                      "    pm.environment.set('logged_user_id', jsonData.user.id);",
                      "    console.log('Token set successfully for user: ' + jsonData.user.username);",
                      "}",
                      "",
                      "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                      "pm.test('Has encoded_token', () => {",
                      "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property('encoded_token');",
                      "});",
                      "pm.test('Has user data', () => {",
                      "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property('user');",
                      "    pm.expect(j.user).to.have.property('username');",
                      "});"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{admin_username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/auth/v1/login/",
                  "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"],
                  "path": ["auth", "v1", "login", ""]
                },
                "description": "## Login\n\nAuthenticates a user and returns a JWT token.\nThe token is automatically saved to the `encoded_token` environment variable.\n\n### Parameters\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| username | string | Yes | Username |\n| password | string | Yes | Password |\n\n### Validations\n- `username` required: 403 \"Username is required.\"\n- `password` required: 403 \"Password is required.\"\n- Invalid credentials: 401 \"Unable to authenticate with provided credentials.\"\n- Inactive user: 403 \"User {username} is inactive.\"\n\n### Response\n- `encoded_token`: JWT token for use in Authorization header\n- `valid_until`: Token expiration datetime\n- `user`: Authenticated user data"
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "Success (200)",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                    "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}" },
                    "url": { "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/auth/v1/login/", "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "v1", "login", ""] }
                  },
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "body": "{\n  \"encoded_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"valid_until\": \"04/01/2026 15:00:00\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"username\": \"admin\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@cnab.com\",\n    \"first_name\": \"\",\n    \"last_name\": \"\",\n    \"is_active\": true,\n    \"is_staff\": true,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-04-01T10:00:00.000000Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2026-04-01T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n  }\n}"
                },
                {
                  "name": "Error - Missing username (403)",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                    "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}" },
                    "url": { "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/auth/v1/login/", "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "v1", "login", ""] }
                  },
                  "status": "Forbidden",
                  "code": 403,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"Username is required.\"\n}"
                },
                {
                  "name": "Error - Invalid credentials (401)",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                    "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"wrongpass\"\n}" },
                    "url": { "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/auth/v1/login/", "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "v1", "login", ""] }
                  },
                  "status": "Unauthorized",
                  "code": 401,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"Unable to authenticate with provided credentials.\"\n}"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "POST Validate Token",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{encoded_token}}" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/auth/v1/validate/",
                  "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"],
                  "path": ["auth", "v1", "validate", ""]
                },
                "description": "## Validate Token\n\nValidates a JWT token and returns the associated user data.\nUse this endpoint to verify if a token is still valid.\n\n### Headers\n| Header | Value | Required |\n|--------|-------|----------|\n| Authorization | Bearer {token} | Yes |\n\n### Validations\n- Missing/malformed Authorization header: 401\n- Invalid token: 403 \"Invalid Token\"\n- Expired token: 403 \"Token expired at {date}\"\n- Inactive user: 403 \"User {username} is inactive.\"\n\n### Response\n- `encoded_token`: The validated token\n- `valid_until`: Token expiration datetime\n- `user`: User data associated with the token"
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "Success (200)",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{encoded_token}}" }],
                    "url": { "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/auth/v1/validate/", "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "v1", "validate", ""] }
                  },
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "body": "{\n  \"encoded_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"valid_until\": \"04/01/2026 15:00:00\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"username\": \"admin\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@cnab.com\",\n    \"first_name\": \"\",\n    \"last_name\": \"\",\n    \"is_active\": true,\n    \"is_staff\": true\n  }\n}"
                },
                {
                  "name": "Error - Invalid token (403)",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer invalid.token.here" }],
                    "url": { "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/auth/v1/validate/", "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "v1", "validate", ""] }
                  },
                  "status": "Forbidden",
                  "code": 403,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"Invalid Token\"\n}"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Users",
          "description": "User CRUD management endpoints.\n\nAll endpoints require authentication via Bearer token.\nCreate/Delete operations require `is_staff=True` or `is_superuser=True`.",
          "item": [
