                  "path": ["users", "v1", "users", "{{target_user_id}}", ""]
                },
                "description": "## Retrieve User\n\nReturns detailed data for a specific user.\n\n### Path Parameters\n| Parameter | Type | Description |\n|-----------|------|-------------|\n| id | integer | User ID |\n\n### Authorization\n- Users can always retrieve their own data\n- Superusers can retrieve any user\n- Staff can retrieve non-superusers\n- Others: 403 Forbidden\n\n### Errors\n- 404: User not found\n- 403: Not authorized to view this user"
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "Success (200)",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{encoded_token}}" }],
                    "url": { "raw": "{{user_service_url}}/users/v1/users/1/", "host": ["{{user_service_url}}"], "path": ["users", "v1", "users", "1", ""] }
                  },
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "body": "{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@cnab.com\",\n  \"first_name\": \"\",\n  \"last_name\": \"\",\n  \"is_active\": true,\n  \"is_staff\": true,\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-04-01T10:00:00.000000Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-04-01T10:00:00.000000Z\"\n}"
                },
                {
