                "description": "## Update User\n\nPartially updates a user's data. Only the provided fields are modified.\n\n### Path Parameters\n| Parameter | Type | Description |\n|-----------|------|-------------|\n| id | integer | User ID |\n\n### Parameters (all optional)\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| username | string | New username (must be unique) |\n| email | string | New email (must be unique) |\n| password | string | New password |\n| first_name | string | First name |\n| last_name | string | Last name |\n\n### Authorization\n- Users can update their own data\n- Staff/superuser can update other users\n- Cannot update superusers (unless you are superuser)"
