                  "path": ["users", "v1", "users", "{{target_user_id}}", ""]
                },
                "description": "## Deactivate User (Soft Delete)\n\nSets the user's `is_active` to `false`. The user is not physically deleted.\n\n### Path Parameters\n| Parameter | Type | Description |\n|-----------|------|-------------|\n| id | integer | User ID |\n\n### Authorization\n- Only staff or superuser can deactivate users\n- Cannot deactivate superusers\n\n### Response\n- 204 No Content on success\n- 403 if not authorized\n- 404 if user not found"
